.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# runs/: keep each run's config (with seed) and metrics, ignore everything else
runs/**
!runs/**/
!runs/**/config.*
!runs/**/metrics.*
# Exception: the three D7 models every result uses, so a fresh clone reproduces the numbers exactly (2026-11-23)
!runs/h10_mask0.25_cmd_seed*/model.pt
# The D12 ablation's models, committed for the same reason (2026-11-25)
!runs/h10_mask0.25_nocmd_seed*/model.pt
